## Climate

### CHIRPS precipitation

- Jan 2022–Dec 2025;
- 48 monthly accumulated precipitation GeoTIFFs;
- `PREC_AAAA_MM.tif`;
- mm/month;
- ~5 km (0.05°);
- EPSG:4326.

### CHIRTS-ERA5 temperature

- Jan 2022–Dec 2025;
- 48 Tmin + 48 Tmax rasters;
- monthly means of daily minima/maxima;
- °C;
- ~5 km;
- EPSG:4326;
- NoData = -9999.

