## Topography

Delivered products:

- `Elevacion_INEGI_CEM4_120m.tif`;
- `Pendiente_INEGI_CEM4_120m_grados.tif`;
- EPSG:6372;
- NoData = -9999;
- delivered raster product resolution 120 m.

